$ -d test.db -e "CREATE TABLE t (id INT, v TEXT); INSERT INTO t VALUES (1,'one');"
已创建表 `t`（2 列）
插入了 1 行
! bg --hold=2000  (SQL: SELECT * FROM t;)
! bg is up: it holds the database now
$ -d test.db --lock-wait=4000 -e "INSERT INTO t VALUES (2,'waited');"
插入了 1 行
! wait -> it is gone
! --- its stdout ---
+----+-----+
| id | v   |
+----+-----+
| 1  | one |
+----+-----+
(1 行)
[--hold] 库还开着，锁还拿着，等 2000 毫秒再退。
! bg --hold=3000  (SQL: SELECT * FROM t;)
! bg is up: it holds the database now
$ -d test.db --lock-wait=400 -e "INSERT INTO t VALUES (3,'too late');"
错误：库 test.db 现在有别的进程开着，写不了它——要改数据就得等那个进程关掉。（等了 400 毫秒也没等到）
! exit 2
! wait -> it is gone
! --- its stdout ---
+----+--------+
| id | v      |
+----+--------+
| 1  | one    |
| 2  | waited |
+----+--------+
(2 行)
[--hold] 库还开着，锁还拿着，等 3000 毫秒再退。
$ -d test.db -e "SELECT * FROM t ORDER BY id;"
+----+--------+
| id | v      |
+----+--------+
| 1  | one    |
| 2  | waited |
+----+--------+
(2 行)